From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Vicory <dvicory@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): scope worker handoff guidance by workspace

Build native and broker worker guidance from the trusted workspace mode at
prompt construction instead of import time, so broker-only output and handoff
instructions cannot leak into native workers. Scope the completion schema's
artifact wording through the same signal while preserving relative manifests,
trusted attachment selection, and no prose path discovery. Keep focused tests
for both runtime modes and the zero-schema boundary.
---
